Weimar Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?][? if z_r_oldenburg:&nbsp;+&nbsp;<span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span> ?][? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;+&nbsp;<span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?]): [+ weimar_coalition_oldenburg +]% 

Bourgeois Coalition ([? if aspd_r_oldenburg: <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> + ?][? if z_r_oldenburg: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ z_party_name +]**</span> + ?][? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] + <span style="color: #11DD11;">**SLV**</span> + <span style="color: #b8948f;">**WP**</span> + <span style="color: #0075EB;">**VRP**</span>[? if kvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span> ?] + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**DNVP**</span>): [+ true_bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg +]%


