@oldenburg_achievement
go-to: alt_aber_gold if aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote >= 5 and oldenburg_election_seen == 1; oldenburg_coalition_menu if aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote < 5 or oldenburg_election_seen != 1

@alt_aber_gold
achievement: alt_aber_gold
go-to: oldenburg_coalition_menu

@oldenburg_coalition_menu
on-arrival: {!
let dvp_toleration_threshold = 50;
let lvp_toleration_threshold = 60;
if (!Q.dvp_reform) {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 5;
} else if (Q.dvp_reform) {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 5;
}
if (Q.dvp_ideology != "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.dvp_ideology == "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 10;
}
if (Q.lvp_ideology != "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.lvp_ideology == "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 5;
}
if (Q.left_coalition_oldenburg >= 50) {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 15;
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 15;
}
if ((Q.dvp_relation >= dvp_toleration_threshold && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation >= lvp_toleration_threshold && Q.lvp_formed)) {
    Q.toleration_possible_oldenburg = 1;
} else {
    Q.toleration_possible_oldenburg = 0;
}
if (((Q.z_relation >= 45 || !Q.stegerwald_path) && ((Q.dvp_relation >= (dvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation >= (lvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && Q.lvp_formed)))) {
    Q.groko_coalition_possible_oldenburg = 1;
} else {
    Q.groko_coalition_possible_oldenburg = 0;
}
if (Q.z_relation >= 50 || !Q.stegerwald_path) {
    Q.weimar_coalition_possible_oldenburg = 1;
} else {
    Q.weimar_coalition_possible_oldenburg = 0;
}
if ((Q.dvp_relation < (dvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation < (lvp_toleration_threshold + 5) && Q.lvp_formed)) {
    Q.dvp_toleration_threshold_fail_oldenburg = 1;
} else {
    Q.dvp_toleration_threshold_fail_oldenburg = 0;
}
!}

<hr id="read-marker">
The bourgeois parties have historically been hostile to us in state politics, particularly after the notorious <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>-<span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> United Left government faced a <i>Reichsexekution</i> six years ago. The split of our reformist wing into the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> further pushed our state organization toward the left.

[? if aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote <= 3: With the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span>'s disastrous result of [+ aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote +]%, their viability as a political force in the state is coming to an end, with bourgeois parties are seeking a replacement for Max Heldt. ?][? if aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote > 3: The <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> has not suffered the decline we thought it would, winning [+ aspd_oldenburg_elections_vote +]% of the vote. Whether Max Heldt remains is up to the bourgeois parties. ?] Despite our cooperation on the local level, the national <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span> is unlikely to ever accept a coalition.

- @bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg
- @grand_coalition_oldenburg
- @united_left_oldenburg
- @weimar_coalition_oldenburg
- @no_majority


@toleration_oldenburg
title: We will enter a toleration agreement with the incumbent government.
choose-if: toleration_possible_oldenburg and left_strength < 30
unavailable-subtitle: [? if not toleration_possible_oldenburg: The bourgeois parties won't even accept our toleration. ?][? if left_strength >= 30: Our Saxon organization is too left-wing to even consider this as an option. With the reformists having largely split into the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">ASPD</span>, the left wing is dominant. ?]
on-arrival: oldenburg_toleration = 1; old_middle_nsdap -= 1; rural_nsdap -= 1; workers_spd += 1; workers_kpd += 2; left_dissent += 10

We have entered a toleration agreement with the bourgeois cabinet, and have made it unnecessary for them to cooperate with the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>. As part of our agreement, the bourgeois parties have allowed Max Heldt to retain his Minister-President position, and for the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> to occupy the Work and Welfare	ministry. 

Despite the unsavory qualities of the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span>, they're still Marxist at the end of the day. The leftist Saxon organization has protested at our intervention, and many have jumped ship to the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>.


@bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg
title: A bourgeois coalition is formed.
subtitle: The incumbent coalition, which will survive on toleration from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>.
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg >= 50 and true_bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg < 50
on-arrival: oldenburg_right = 1; oldenburg_leader = "Bünger"; oldenburg_irl = 1

The incumbent coalition has failed to win a majority, and toleration from the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> is required. They've demanded the exclusion of the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span>[? if not lvp_formed:&nbsp;and <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>?] from the cabinet, and the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?]'s new Minister-President Wilhelm Bünger has no choice but to agree. However, this decision was soon reverted and the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> is granted the Ministry of Work and Welfare. 

Despite the exclusion of many supporting parties from the cabinet in favor of non-partisan figures, they choose to tolerate the coalition nonetheless.


@grand_coalition_oldenburg
title: A [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span>?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Grand?] Coalition is formed!
subtitle: We have somehow reconciled with the bourgeois parties, that they're willing to govern with us again.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if z_relation < 45 and stegerwald_path: We need higher relations with the [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]. ?][? if dvp_toleration_threshold_fail_oldenburg: We need higher relations with the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">DVP</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">LVP</span>?]. ?][? if left_strength >= 15: Our Saxon organization is too left-wing to even consider this as an option—after all, their stubborn refusal in the past led to the expulsion of the majority of the parliamentary faction and the subsequent formation of the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">ASPD</span>. ?]
view-if: groko_coalition_oldenburg >= 50
choose-if: groko_coalition_possible_oldenburg and left_strength < 15
on-arrival: oldenburg_groko = 1; workers_nsdap -= 3; unemployed_nsdap -= 3; workers_spd += 3; unemployed_spd += 3; z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3; lvp_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 5; pro_republic += 3; reformist_dissent -= 15; reformist_strength += 10; aspd_dead = 1

Somehow, the bourgeois parties are willing to form a [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span>?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Grand?] Coalition with us, rather than continuing their current government with Max Heldt and the right-wing parties.

With the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> (whose Saxon chapter is notably more sane) now convinced of our reformist path, they have rejoined the Saxon <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>!


@weimar_coalition_oldenburg
title: A [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span>?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Weimar?] Coalition is formed!
subtitle: Center suprisingly is not against governing.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if z_relation < 50 and stegerwald_path: The Center Party will not let us. [? if z_party_name != "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">Center Party</span>?][? if z_party_name == "CVP": <span style="color: #000000;">**CVP**</span>?]. ?][? if left_strength >= 25: Our Saxon organization is too left-wing to even consider this as an option—after all, their stubborn refusal in the past led to the expulsion of the majority of the parliamentary faction and the subsequent formation of the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">ASPD</span>. ?]
view-if: weimar_coalition_oldenburg >= 50
choose-if: weimar_coalition_possible_oldenburg and left_strength < 25
on-arrival: oldenburg_weimar = 1; workers_nsdap -= 4; unemployed_nsdap -= 4; workers_spd += 3; unemployed_spd += 3; z_relation += 3; ddp_relation += 3; lvp_relation += 3; dvp_relation += 5; pro_republic += 3; reformist_dissent -= 15; reformist_strength += 10; aspd_dead = 1

Somehow, the bourgeois parties are willing to form a [? if lvp_formed and stegerwald_path: <span style="color: #000000;">We</span><span style="color: #DD0000;">im</span><span style="color: #FFCC00;">ar</span>?][? if not lvp_formed or not stegerwald_path: Grand?] Coalition with us, rather than continuing their current government with Max Heldt and the right-wing parties.

With the <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> (whose Saxon chapter is notably more sane) now convinced of our reformist path, they have rejoined the Saxon <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>!


@united_left_oldenburg
title: The <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> will form a coalition government with the <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>.
subtitle: History will repeat itself.
view-if: left_coalition_oldenburg >= 50 and (kpd_relation >= 35 and kpd_leader == "Conciliators") or (kpd_relation >= 55 and kpd_leader != "Conciliators")
on-arrival: red_oldenburg = 1; z_relation -= 7; ddp_relation -= 7; dvp_relation -= 7; lvp_relation -= 7; coup_progress += 5; hindenburg_angry += 60; rfb_militancy += 0.08; rfb_strength += 150; sa_strength += 80; sh_strength += 80; strife += 1; workers_spd += 5; workers_kpd += 5; unemployed_spd += 5; new_middle_spd -= 5 if new_middle_conscious == 0; old_middle_spd -= 5; rural_spd -= 5 if rural_conscious == 0; communist_coalition += 3; kpd_relation += 15
on-display: {!  
    var cardEl = document.createElement('div');  
    cardEl.className = "face-figure2";  

    var image = new Image();  
    image.className = "face-img";  
    image.src = "img/redoldenburg.png";  

    cardEl.appendChild(image);  
    var contentDiv = document.querySelector("#page #mid_panel #content");
    contentDiv.appendChild(cardEl);
!}

Surprisingly, despite reluctance on both sides due to fears that the <span style="color: #808080;">reactionary</span> Hindenburg will order a <i>Reichsexekution</i> if a coalition were to form, <span style="color: #c00000;">Red</span> oldenburg is restored! 

As one of the most left-wing and industrial states in Germany, we will use our leverage to implement comprehensive reforms and transform oldenburg into a stronghold of <span style="color: #c00000;">socialism</span>. Hindenburg’s patience is especially thin. Tread carefully.

@no_majority
title: No majority can be found!
subtitle: [? if bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg < 50 and spd_coalition_oldenburg < 50: All possible coalitions lack a majority. ?][? if spd_coalition_oldenburg >= 50 and not spd_coalition_possible_oldenburg: The bourgeois parties are antagonistic to our Saxon organization. ?][? if spd_coalition_oldenburg >= 50 and left_strength >= 15: Our party itself rejects the possibility of a majority coalition with the liberals. ?]
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_oldenburg < 50 and (not spd_coalition_possible_oldenburg or left_strength >= 15)
on-arrival: {!
let dvp_toleration_threshold = 30;
let lvp_toleration_threshold = 40;
if (!Q.dvp_reform) {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 5;
} else if (Q.dvp_reform) {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 5;
}
if (Q.dvp_ideology != "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.dvp_ideology == "Left") {
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 10;
}
if (Q.lvp_ideology != "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold += 10;
} else if (Q.lvp_ideology == "Left") {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 5;
}
if (Q.united_left_oldenburg >= 50) {
    lvp_toleration_threshold -= 15;
    dvp_toleration_threshold -= 15;
}
if (Q.oldenburg_no_majority) {
    lvp_toleration_threshold = 0;
    dvp_toleration_threshold = 0;
}
if ((Q.dvp_relation >= dvp_toleration_threshold && !Q.lvp_formed) || (Q.lvp_relation >= lvp_toleration_threshold && Q.lvp_formed)) { 
    Q.toleration_possible_oldenburg = 1;
} else {
    Q.toleration_possible_oldenburg = 0;
}
!}

With the bourgeois parties unable to secure a majority even with the toleration of the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span>, and their refusal to form a coalition with us, no viable majority can be established. The ruling coalition fears that calling new elections will only accelerate their decline and further erode their support.

In an effort to avoid this, they are more open to negotiating a toleration agreement.

- @toleration_oldenburg
- @no_majority_2

@no_majority_2
title: A majority still can't be found!
subtitle: [? if not toleration_possible_oldenburg: This is getting ridiculous. ?][? if toleration_possible_oldenburg: We will refuse to tolerate the bourgeois government, forcing new elections. ?]
on-arrival: oldenburg_election_2_trigger_time = time + 3; oldenburg_no_majority = 1 if not oldenburg_no_majority; oldenburg_no_majority += 1 if oldenburg_no_majority; new_middle_nsdap += 2; old_middle_nsdap += 2; rural_nsdap += 1; unemployed_nsdap += 2; pro_republic -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2 if toleration_possible_oldenburg; old_middle_spd -= 2 if toleration_possible_oldenburg; rural_spd -= 1 if toleration_possible_oldenburg

A coalition of all the parties to the right of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> isn't possible, and the [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**DVP**</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">**LVP**</span>?] is refusing any form of a Grand Coalition including us.

With no viable alternatives, the Landtag faces dissolution, triggering new elections—an opportunity the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**NSDAP**</span> hopes to exploit by capitalizing on political instability and the perceived failure of parliamentary democracy.

[? if oldenburg_no_majority > 1: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 2: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 3: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 4: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 5: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 6: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 7: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 8: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 9: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 10: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 11: Please stop. ?][? if oldenburg_no_majority > 12: Please stop. ?]

@spd_majority
title: Form an SPD only government!
subtitle: Sweat...
view-if: spd_r_oldenburg >= 50 
on-arrival: oldenburg_spd = 1; reformist_dissent -= 5; left_dissent -= 30; left_strength += 10; center_dissent -= 10; labor_dissent -= 10; aspd_dead = 1; workers_spd += 7; workers_kpd -= 4; new_middle_spd += 3; old_middle_spd += 2; unemployed_spd += 4; unemployed_nsdap -= 3; pro_republic += 5

Unexpectedly, we've found ourselves controlling a majority of the Oldenburg landtag and being able to form a government of just the <span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span>! It is unclear how the bourgeois and <span style="color: #808080;">reactionaries</span> will react to a <span style="color: #c00000;">Red</span> oldenburg but without the <span style="color: #700000;">**Communists**</span>... [? if aspd_share > 0: The <span style="color: #fe9e00;">**ASPD**</span> seeing as we no longer require on coalition negotiations to form government has decided to join us. ?] 
